"art", "nsfw": false, "body": "おはりさんに欲を押し付けたいと思います。\n多口さんの「……食べて、ください」の件か、尾未柘榴と多口綾さんが並んでいる感じのイラストをお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-4TaklVMR1IDsAyebcTFdTRKCiuIz2Qv", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainoji_321/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0709842/uploads/origins/1b46e4ef-76a1-4e7d-b977-32712d338964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1f0572a8cd65aeebed0eb1827fa4a36", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0709842/uploads/origins/1b46e4ef-76a1-4e7d-b977-32712d338964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1f0572a8cd65aeebed0eb1827fa4a36, https://si.imgix.net/d0709842/uploads/origins/1b46e4ef-76a1-4e7d-b977-32712d338964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec9fb20f4d362e52a5a0fe5341082b37 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d0709842/uploads/origins/1b46e4ef-76a1-4e7d-b977-32712d338964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45edbc73945893cc3c6bf80639127ac6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "竹谷とあんびるがみたいです　とは言えあんびるはいてもいなくてもいいです　でもおもちィはどこかに描いて欲しいです", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainoji_321/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/83831780/uploads/origins/fd32e1fc-8160-470f-9a6a-3be5dd4e06d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0456c5e34819f20895a4e570aa4e10de", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83831780/uploads/origins/fd32e1fc-8160-470f-9a6a-3be5dd4e06d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0456c5e34819f20895a4e570aa4e10de, https://si.imgix.net/83831780/uploads/origins/fd32e1fc-8160-470f-9a6a-3be5dd4e06d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a118e7fd7eb2bdd5f7bf08dbb2564be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83831780/uploads/origins/fd32e1fc-8160-470f-9a6a-3be5dd4e06d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&